WEBVTT

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:00.257
We need everybody.

00:14:00.257 --> 00:14:02.985
Everybody has a valid perspective.

00:14:03.485 --> 00:14:07.711
Second, we work to one standard only:

00:14:07.711 --> 00:14:10.310
the best imaginable.

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:13.632
And third, he told his boss,
Geoff Tudhope,

00:14:13.632 --> 00:14:15.605
that he had to butt out,

00:14:15.605 --> 00:14:18.856
because he knew
how disruptive power can be.

00:14:18.856 --> 00:14:21.689
Now, this didn't mean Tudhope did nothing.

00:14:21.689 --> 00:14:23.430
He gave the team air cover,

00:14:23.430 --> 00:14:27.540
and he listened to ensure
that they honored their principles.

00:14:28.190 --> 00:14:34.260
And it worked: Ahead of all the other
companies tackling this hard problem,